ra una época que ya no apreciaba las emociones enfáticas»; lo continúan Gastr Del Sol, For Carnation, June Of 44, Rachel's. Chicago lo codifica con acento alemán (Can, Faust, Neu): Tortoise y sus descendientes, Jim O'Rourke (de Cage y Derek Bailey a Fahey y el pop orquestal), DK3, Isotope 217. El rock instrumental (Don Caballero, Godspeed You Black Emperor, Dirty Three, Mogwai, Labradford, Stars Of The Lid); Alemania (Mouse On Mars, To Rococo Rot, Notwist), el «noise-core» japonés (Zeni Geva, Merzbow, Boredoms) y Old Time Relijun, discípulos de Beefheart.","color":"#2dd4bf","family":"Vanguardia, electrónica y ambient","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#post-rock"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":190314886046009,"artist":"Old Time Relijun","artist_id":161353241058516,"title":"Songbook Vol 1","year":1997,"ess":0,"yt":"MGmWSvdQGO8","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Post-rock","scene_id":245950225873330,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#post-rock","chapters":["Sección 6.21"],"pages":[[1,296,null]]},{"id":58907275464000,"artist":"Old Time Relijun","artist_id":161353241058516,"title":"Utereus And Fire","year":1999,"ess":0,"yt":"hChG3XjtCqs","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Post-rock","scene_id":245950225873330,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#post-rock","chapters":["Sección 6.21"],"pages":[[1,296,null]]},{"id":12693199297721,"artist":"Old Time Relijun","artist_id":161353241058516,"title":"Witchcraft Rebellion","year":2001,"ess":0,"yt":"TImff0p2hks","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Post-rock","scene_id":245950225873330,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#post-rock","chap